-- A fill owes counselling until a Counselling exists for it, and a fill that owes counselling
-- is not picked up. The spec does not declare Counselling.
--
-- The compiler prints two messages for the one missing name, on top of the one about PickUp.
-- The first says where the name is written; the second repeats it with nothing added.
act Fill { fillNumber: integer }

transient act PickUp { fill: one Fill }

shape CounsellingDue = Fill where not exists Counselling for this

never (PickUp where fill is CounsellingDue)
